## Finish
Run `fulcrum finish --bead {{bead}} --thread-id {{thread}} --ownership-operation {{ownership_operation}} --outcome OUTCOME --input - --json`. Use `answered` with `summary` and `evidence`, `planned` with `summary` and `plan_id`, `ready` with concise implementation scope in `summary`, a nonempty `acceptance` array of observable checks, and optional `evidence` references, or `blocked` with `summary`, `blocker`, `attempts`, and `required_action`.
